  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">저작권법 제</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">25</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">조 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">항 과 관련해서는 김민우 선생님께서 자세히 올려주셨구요.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">아래의 글은 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">새교육 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2014.10</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월호 &nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">‘</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">문답으로 알아보는 저작권</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의 글을 요약한 것입니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교의 수업을 지원하기 위해 공표된 저작물의 일부분을 복제</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">,</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">배포</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">,</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공연</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">,</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">방송 또는 전송할 수 있다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">즉 저작권은 수업 목적으로 제한된다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">여기서 수업이란 교실 수업 뿐만 아니라 교사가 수업자료</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교안</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 만들면서 자료를 활용하거나 같은 교과목 교사끼리 자료를 공유하는 과정도 필요한데 이러한 과정 역시 수업의 개념에 포함된다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">단</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">자료를 공유할 때 일반인의 접근을 허용하지 않는 상황에서 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">‘</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">해당 교사</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">까리 한정된 범위 안에서 이루어져야 한다는 제한 조건이 붙는다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-----------------------------------------------------------------</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">즉, '교사들간의 자료 공유는 가능하지만, 일반인의 접근을 허용하지 않는다'&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">는 것이죠.</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><STRONG></STRONG>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG>그래서 카페 회원 등급을 조정하고자 </STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">회원님들께 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">회원 정보에 대한 수정을</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp;부탁드렸던 것입니다.</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>회원 정보 수정의 3가지<SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"> 질문 내용인 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">성함 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">근무학교명 및 근무지역 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대학전공 및 교직경력 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">을 정확하게 작성해주십시오.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">앞으로&nbsp;3주</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\"> 정도의 수정 기간이 남았습니다.</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG>&nbsp;그 이후에는 </STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG>&nbsp;회원 정보를 수정 하신 분들만</STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">카페의 게시물들을 보시고 다운로드 받으실 수 있도록 할 예정입니다.</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG>더 활발한 교사들간의 교류 공간이 되길 기대합니다.</STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG>고맙습니다.</STRONG></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><STRONG></STRONG></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><STRONG></STRONG>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
